#: biglinux-config/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-config/ui/about_dialog.py:33
msgid ""
"Restore, back up, and manage application settings on BigLinux.\n"
"\n"
"Restore Settings detects supported native and Flatpak applications, restores "
"either BigLinux defaults or the application's own defaults, and exports or "
"imports selected settings using compressed backups with integrity checks and "
"rollback protection."
msgstr ""
"Instellingen van toepassingen op BigLinux herstellen, er back-ups van maken "
"en beheren.\n"
"\n"
"Instellingen herstellen herkent ondersteunde native en Flatpak-toepassingen, "
"herstelt de standaardinstellingen van BigLinux of van de toepassing zelf en "
"exporteert of importeert geselecteerde instellingen via gecomprimeerde back-"
"ups met integriteitscontroles en het terugdraaien van wijzigingen bij fouten."

